{"tool_name":"turtleseg:-3d-image-segmentation-software","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>TurtleSeg is an interactive 3D image segmentation tool. TurtleSeg has an automated system, Spotlight, for automatically directing the user towards the next steps. Typically, a user loads a 3D image and then manually contour a sparse number of slices, the full 3D segmentation can then be built automatically.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>TurtleSeg is an interactive 3D image segmentation tool. TurtleSeg has an automated system, Spotlight, for automatically directing the user towards the next steps. Typically, a user loads a 3D image and then manually contour a sparse number of slices, the full 3D segmentation can then be built automatically.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-11-13T11:58:11+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2016-10-25T12:56:48+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505204895,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[],"has_function":[{"target_id":4156,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Interactive_segmentation","url":"/interactive-segmentation"}],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4341,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"4e110085-0702-47e5-85ef-0e06e082eb70","url":"/taxonomy/term/4341"}],"has_interaction_level":[{"target_id":3572,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"551f908e-bb43-410a-9420-9d98f12442a0","url":"/taxonomy/term/3572"},{"target_id":3573,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"43cf6a59-36ad-49c8-9baa-3c5494481f13","url":"/taxonomy/term/3573"}],"has_license":[{"value":"commercial"}],